      "choice": "Strategy 4 (Buy & Hold) executes its single purchase on the first bar where strategy next() executes after indicator minperiod warm-up.",
      "reason": "Adheres strictly to Canonical Default 6 regarding indicator warm-up and automatic minperiod handling."
